OL,3,GNEWSASurvey reveals 'major increase' in
OL,4,Acost of living                         
OL,6,FThere has been "a major increase" in   
OL,7,Fthe overall cost of living in the past 
OL,8,F12 months in Guernsey, Jersey and the  
OL,9,FIsle of Man, a survey has found.       
OL,11,FIsland Global Research, a market       
OL,12,Fresearch and consultancy company, found
OL,13,Fmore than 69% of respondents in Jersey,
OL,14,F68% in Guernsey and 70% in the Isle of 
OL,15,FMan said they had noticed a cost       
OL,16,Fincrease.                              
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
