OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASurvey reveals 'major increase' in
OL,4,Acost of living                         
OL,6,FThe survey, which was completed by over
OL,7,F1,000 people in each island, saw 57% of
OL,8,Frespondents describe themselves as     
OL,9,F"less than comfortable" with about one 
OL,10,Fin 10 going without essentials like    
OL,11,Ffood and heating.                      
OL,13,FThe survey also found 65% said they now
OL,14,Fspent less on non essentials and 53%   
OL,15,Fsaid they are shopping around more     
OL,16,Fbecause of the price rises.            
